{"strongs": "H2696", "word": "חֶצְרוֺן", "translit": "chets.ron", "root": "חצר", "morph": "N:N-M-P", "pos": "proper name, of a location and person", "gloss": "Hezron", "definition": "חֶצְרוֺן , חֶצְרֹן proper name, of a location and person (compare Sabean חצֿרן proper name, of a location or tribe Hal No. 661 DHM ZMG 1883,15 ) — 1. proper name, of a location ᵐ5 Ασωρων , Ασερων , Εσρωμ : \\ \\ a. חֶצְרוֺן Josh 15:3 place in extreme south of Judah, + אַדָּ֫רָה = חֲצַראַֿדָּר (q. v.) Num 34:4 . \\ \\ b. קְרִיּוֺת חֶצְרוֺן הִיא חָצוֺר Josh 15:25 another town of Judah in south. 2. proper name, masculine ᵐ5 Ασρωμ ( ν ), Εσρων , etc.: \\ \\ a. חֶצְרֹן son of Reuben Gen 46:9 ; Exod 6:14 ; Num 26:6 = חֶצְרוֺן 1Chr 5:3 . \\ \\ b. son of Peres and grandson of Judah Gen 46:12 ; Num 26:21 = חֶצְרוֺן Ruth 4:18 ; Ruth 4:19 ; 1Chr 2:5 ; 1Chr 2:9 ; 1Chr 2:18 ; 1Chr 2:21 ; 1Chr 2:24 (twice in verse); 1Chr 2:25 ; 1Chr 4:1 .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB3060')\">BDB3060</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H2696')\">H2696</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB3059')\">BDB3059</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB3061')\">BDB3061</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>חֶצְרוֺן</bdbheb>, <bdbheb>חֶצְרֹן</bdbheb> <b>proper name, of a location and person</b> (compare Sabean <bdbheb>חצֿרן</bdbheb> proper name, of a location or tribe <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Hal')\">Hal<sup>No. 661</sup></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('DHM')\">DHM<sup>ZMG 1883,15</sup></lookup>) — <div class=\"point\"><b>1. proper name, of a location</b> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sept')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵐ5</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> <grk>Ασωρων</grk>, <grk>Ασερων</grk>, <grk>Εσρωμ</grk>: <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>a.</b> <bdbheb>חֶצְרוֺן</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Josh 15:3\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(6,15,3)\">Josh 15:3</ref> place in extreme south of Judah, + <bdbheb>אַדָּ֫רָה</bdbheb> = <bdbheb>חֲצַראַֿדָּר</bdbheb> (q. v.) <ref ref=